  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the shadow of Feather-Tail Garage, Rivet was abandoned as a wee hatchling. He learned to scrounge and scrap early, earning his keep by fixing up rust-bucket vehicles for the local flock. His knack for engineering and scavenging the Wastes quickly made him indispensable.",
    "class": "Mechanic",
    "name": "Rivet",
    "personality": "Rivet is fiercely independent and resourceful, preferring to rely on his wit and mechanical skills to get by. He's also fiercely loyal to those who earn his trust and is not afraid to get his flippers dirty in a fight, despite his small size. A bit of a loner, Rivet often mumbles to himself while tinkering, leading some to believe he's cracked from the scarcity of DRIP.",
    "specialAbility": {
      "description": "Can jury-rig temporary field repairs on vehicles or mechanical defenses mid-battle, restoring a small amount of health and granting a temporary stat boost to the repaired unit.",
